  id: prologue.reachportal
  displayName: Something Is Coming
  description: Something much larger is approaching. Leave the camp, take the old path north to the standing stones, and wake them.
  chain: Prologue - The Unquiet Forest
  journalNotes: 'Whatever it is, the trees are moving out of its way. Don''t stop to look.


    Sigrid has seen writing like this once before, and she doesn''t say where. The stones are older than the road, and much older than anyone who should know how to use them.'
